      "title_zh": "前特斯拉 AI 主管 Andrej Karpathy 展示由 Claude Opus 5 生成的指环王 3D 渲染网页",
      "title_orig": "Re More on the pelican on the bicycle test from @simonw: https://simonwillison.net/2025/Jun/6/six-months-in-llms/ I uploaded the source here so it's p...",
