      "title_zh": "大语言模型测试正脱离简单指令阶段，Claude 3 Opus 消耗百万 Token 编写五千行代码实现指环王场景渲染",
      "title_orig": "We're starting to leave the territory where you'd test an LLM by e.g. \"create an svg of pelican on a bicycle\". As one idea to generalize it, I was int...",
